NOTE ON THE HYMN LIBRARY

This licence covers the SOFTWARE only. It does not grant any rights in the
hymn texts distributed alongside it.

The library seeded by supabase/migrations/0013_fbc_hymnal.sql and by
desktop/resources/hymnal-seed.json is made up of hymns believed to be in the
public domain. Hymns whose words are still under copyright are shipped as
metadata only — title, author, composer and key, with no lyrics — precisely so
that no copyrighted text is redistributed here. See
docs/hymnal-copyright-review.md for the review behind that, including the
titles still awaiting a human check.

If you fork this project and add hymn texts of your own, the licence covering
those texts is yours to determine and yours to comply with. A CCLI licence or
equivalent is the church's responsibility, not this project's.
